Strafing.png", "id": "5034124696658622", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570299_5034124713325287_3346940202929580509_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vrsqXan50bkQ7kNvwEYBckh&_nc_oc=AdoI9U3uyjgBzTvN_lqll7-yFvSIRKd5Iat77sKBQCM6jlK9qhTptbT3T0Ycl2pgLvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzpbe-18DGzU91XXhLNN6uFCsaEj-0CkVg3AF2YObR3-A&oe=69CA7368"}, {"file_name": "3dRudder - Turn movement.png", "id": "451601409421792", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210896_451601412755125_7653260949154147132_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZdwFcvTrcg8Q7kNvwHVruf2&_nc_oc=Adow6THlsi3bE38XxidI2oCdrF1kNX64tW0_e4ESHrOArginxvxNoJt9B8hi0qTySxs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfweEftMST3OsZVRqLFJAMSFwwJh43ijgYn2zpfsiXMRXg&oe=69CA6103"}, {"file_name": "3dRudder - Mini experience.png", "id": "1415471922149561", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75488379_1415471932149560_6748285516086168429_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XwqgseyEosEQ7kNvwHT7JXf&_nc_oc=Ado319m3dJiPLvE6KiPkJIFov9mksUVn1Au1gG1GvSZdImaqd-aTHoHYblrsvLl9_YE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxEQUWc-_IStlgqdZl6yar_A3rqmNUBXiirFnKuU1y1Aw&oe=69CA687C"}, {"file_name": "3dRudder - Exploding a balloon.png", "id": "463002951560087", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75297584_463002954893420_510912844357616824_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZZ3-8bTru2gQ7kNvwFDzYN9&_nc_oc=Adpvh8bTik2pPjp-V3GPu7mLGzFEVeeET0u5eHNEgpkz_1Xc-Lm7EE8CSvODmx5HoMY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwSauWIgtS97ZAfPSfGEy5hfnZ8AZPlRxK6UXcU-V2pRw&oe=69CA7515"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "3dRudder Setup & Tutorial", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The 3dRudder Wireless is a foot motion controller, a new kind of peripheral designed for handling motion at the feet while seated:\n- It offers 4 axes, all progressive and combinable: forward/backward, left/right strafe, left/right turn, up/down,\n- It enables 3 types of locomotion: flat, 3D (ex. Helicopter), and Steering (ex. Airplane piloting),\n- Super intuitive, it lets you achieve in seconds impossible movements like orbiting around a target while shooting at it,\n- It is used seated, providing a relaxing, effortless and secure experience to the user,\n- Anyone can use it, even non gamers, in a matter of seconds,\n- Finally, combined with the hand-tracking features of the Quest, it\u2019s a game changer as the combination provides the users with an experience incredibly close to reality.\n\nThis setup and tutorial app will let you:\n- Pair your 3dRudder with your Quest / Quest 2,\n- Discover each of the 4 individual axis,\n- Use those axes together in 2 experiences.", "short_description": "The 3dRudder Setup & Tutorial app lets you pair your 3dRudder Wireless foot motion controller with your Oculus Quest / Quest 2. It also provides a tutorial to learn how to use your 3dRudder, as well as 2 small experiences where you'll explode balloons with your hands, first on a flat surface, then in a 3D space. Please note, this app may be used entirely in hand tracking mode: only the 2 small experiences require hand tracking as you'll be moving with the feet while acting with your bare hands."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.3drudder.com/privacy-statement/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "3dRudder", "support_website_url": "https://support.3drudder.com/portal/en/kb/english", "website_url": "https://3dRudder.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["UTILITY"], "has_in_app